lation validation and is_click selection','Reported task metrics and existing length bins','Same one-epoch recipe and information boundary'],\n    'remaining_confounds':['Historical controls use a narrower scorer and different initialization trajectory','No matched equal-compute tuning or repetitions in this round','Historical end-to-end timing can contain system variation'],\n    'decision_if_supported':'Report an empirical validation quality-cost frontier with explicit parameter differences; keep the best click model and identify the closest successful control for later repetition.',\n    'decision_if_not_supported':'Keep uniform10 as incumbent and report all failed tradeoffs; do not equate a completed suite or unused remaining budget with scientific success.'\n   }\n  ],\n  'cost_plan':{\n   'estimate_ref':'baseline-din:328.913s and g2-r0000-match20/rotated20/uniform20/uniform10:289.120-291.190s per complete unit. Runtime protocol estimated_unit_seconds=481.347588 and trial_cap_seconds=1203.368969. Four proposed units budget1925.391s at the conservative estimate, maximum4813.476s if each reaches the host cap. Remaining budget at resolution169222.623s is a snapshot, not a reset; preparation and all failures consume it.',\n   'all_variants_counted':True,\n   'attribution_reserve':'All three controls in this round are counted. Retain at least12 conservative complete units (5776.171s) for consequential follow-up contrasts and paired repetitions if later runtime phases authorize them; do not set or override the frozen seed through model config. Paired user-cluster bootstrap is desirable only if an authorized host interface makes predictions/user clusters available; no sample-independent intervals are invented.',\n   'assessment_reserve':'Retain at least6 conservative units (2888.086s) for later assessment and execution failures. No withheld evaluation is requested in this phase. Freeze exact candidate/control source/config/checkpoint hashes, repetition seeds and suite before any future closed assessment; keep its outcomes out of open research memory.',\n   'stop_rule':'This phase ends after producing proposal.json and four syntax-checked standalone modules. Do not train or install in the coding environment. Host must perform forward/backward, mask and schema preflights before scoring. Never exceed the current deadline or per-trial cap; stop when no useful admissible unit fits after reserves, or integrity fails. Failed checks and unknown execution states remain charged and never authorize automatic duplicate withheld scoring.'\n  }\n },\n 'knowledge_assessments':[]\n}\nassessments=[\n ('unirank-method-infnet','used','The local auxiliary degradation makes historical feedback masks relevant; the pinned benchmark task-mask hub initialization was inspected. Original paper text remains unavailable.','Use the already-authorized masks to partition compression groups, rather than initialize learned task hubs.',['feedback_action','rotated_action','feedback_item','rotated_item'],'No task tokens, hub projections or iterative aggregation/broadcast; inherited DIN readout.','True grouping must improve on occupancy-matched rotation; otherwise this adaptation is unsupported.'),\n ('unirank-method-longer','considered','Local group compression is inherited from the previous trajectory; pinned benchmark forward and section2.3 inspected. Original full paper is unavailable.','No new LONGER component adopted; preserve arithmetic block summaries.',[],'Feedback membership and action-input factorial replace no inner Transformer or recent-query interaction.','If measured cost is not below full-history DIN, the efficiency motivation fails for this implementation.'),\n ('unirank-method-hiformer','considered','Post-pooling field/task interaction is relevant but the observed task loss can first be tested with matched compression controls.','None.',[],'Retain supplied task towers; no hierarchical field/task interaction blocks.','This suite cannot establish a HiFormer effect; a separate matched architectural contrast is needed.'),\n ('unirank-method-hemix','considered','Mixed fixed/feature-conditioned query banks are a possible future comparator, but the earlier target-category/brand branch did not improve click over simple pooling.','None.',[],'No query bank or low-rank token mixer; explicit feedback grouping and inherited target activation.','Null feedback grouping would leave the present hypothesis unsupported and would not refute HeMix.'),\n ('unirank-method-ssr','considered','Post-pooling sparse filtering does not directly test loss of feedback association inside arithmetic means.','None.',[],'No competitive sparse filtering or dense multi-view fusion.','No local SSR claim is made or tested.'),\n ('unirank-method-zenith','considered','Changing identifier embedding capacity would add a distinct explanation to the compression contrast.','None.',[],'All embeddings remain width16; no identifier expansion or token interaction.','This suite cannot establish identifier-capacity benefits.'),\n ('unirank-method-ultrahstu','considered','Retrieved card describes item/action transduction and hybrid attention, but sequence dependency and sparse-attention savings have not been established locally.','None.',[],'Keep one-stage compression and local activation, with no sequence transduction layers.','No UltraHSTU effectiveness claim is tested; lack of feedback benefit would not refute it.'),\n ('unirank-method-unimixer','considered','Flattened-history dense tokenization is a possible alternative; its additional projection capacity would confound this feedback-preservation test.','None.',[],'No history flattening tokenizer or paired-stream mixer.','Current suite cannot establish a flattening advantage; a capacity/cost-matched replacement is needed.'),\n ('unirank-method-hyformer','considered','Global learned query decoding could address broader interactions, but it is not needed to distinguish feedback mixing from scorer input here.',