te before any future closed assessment; keep its outcomes out of open research memory.',\n   'stop_rule':'This phase ends after producing proposal.json and four syntax-checked standalone modules. Do not train or install in the coding environment. Host must perform forward/backward, mask and schema preflights before scoring. Never exceed the current deadline or per-trial cap; stop when no useful admissible unit fits after reserves, or integrity fails. Failed checks and unknown execution states remain charged and never authorize automatic duplicate withheld scoring.'\n  }\n },\n 'knowledge_assessments':[]\n}\nassessments=[\n ('unirank-method-infnet','used','The local auxiliary degradation makes historical feedback masks relevant; the pinned benchmark task-mask hub initialization was inspected. Original paper text remains unavailable.','Use the already-authorized masks to partition compression groups, rather than initialize learned task hubs.',['feedback_action','rotated_action','feedback_item','rotated_item'],'No task tokens, hub projections or iterative aggregation/broadcast; inherited DIN readout.','True grouping must improve on occupancy-matched rotation; otherwise this adaptation is unsupported.'),\n ('unirank-method-longer','considered','Local group compression is inherited from the previous trajectory; pinned benchmark forward and section2.3 inspected. Original full paper is unavailable.','No new LONGER component adopted; preserve arithmetic block summaries.',[],'Feedback membership and action-input factorial replace no inner Transformer or recent-query interaction.','If measured cost is not below full-history DIN, the efficiency motivation fails for this implementation.'),\n ('unirank-method-hiformer','considered','Post-pooling field/task interaction is relevant but the observed task loss can first be tested with matched compression controls.','None.',[],'Retain supplied task towers; no hierarchical field/task interaction blocks.','This suite cannot establish a